# 🗂️ C. Primitivas UI

## C.1 · `Container`

**Uso:** wrapper de ancho máximo con padding lateral consistente.
**Fin:** centrar contenido sin duplicar reglas en cada sección.
**API:** `size?: 'default' | 'narrow'`, `as?: keyof JSX.IntrinsicElements`.

### `src/ui/Container.tsx`

```tsx
import type { ElementType, ReactNode } from "react";
import { cx } from "../utils/cx";

type ContainerSize = "default" | "narrow";

export interface ContainerProps {
  children: ReactNode;
  size?: ContainerSize;
  as?: ElementType;
  className?: string;
}

export function Container({
  children,
  size = "default",
  as: As = "div",
  className,
}: ContainerProps) {
  return (
    <As className={cx("container", size === "narrow" && "container--narrow", className)}>
      {children}
    </As>
  );
}
```

